    "body": "The definition of `GetAffectedKeys()` and its only caller were removed in 83af1a3cca (\"wallet: Delete LegacySPKM\"), but the declaration in `scriptpubkeyman.h` was left behind. The symbol has had no definition and no callers since then. Remove the stale declaration so the header reflects the implemented interface.\n\nTesting:\n- `cmake --build build -j4`\n- `build/bin/test_bitcoin --run_test=scriptpubkeyman_tests`",
